# Speeds up local execution but clutters the GitHub repo
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# --- Database Files ---
# Prevents your local patient data from being pushed to the cloud
*.db
*.sqlite3

# --- IDE & Editor Settings ---
# Ignores settings specific to your VS Code setup
.vscode/
.idea/
.project
.pydevproject

# --- Operating System Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db